    "title": "Ex-Horry Co. deputy chief cites 'political pressure' in retirement after 40 years - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Juliet Colville ,\n9 hours ago HORRY COUNTY, S.C. (WPDE) — Former Police Deputy Chief Lance Winburn released a statement about his retirement from the Horry County Police Department (HCPD). The announcement comes after the department recently completed an internal affairs investigation into a 2022 arrest. The investigation found that an HCPD policy violation occurred in relation to the incident. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
